+## moranbuy
+
+### `GET /api/admin/moranbuy`
+
+- **Access:** Bearer token with `businesses.read`.
+
+### `POST /api/admin/moranbuy/register`
+
+- **Access:** Bearer token with `businesses.read` and `businesses.manage`.
+
+Body:
+
+| Field | Type | |
+|---|---|---|
+| `businessName` | string, min 2, max 160 | optional, default `"MoranBuy"` |
+| `ownerEmail` | email, max 255 | required |
+| `reason` | string, max 500 | optional |
+
+### `GET /api/admin/moranbuy/signup-config`
+
+- **Access:** Bearer token with `businesses.read`.
+
+### `POST /api/admin/moranbuy/whatsapp/connect`
+
+- **Access:** Bearer token with `businesses.read` and `channels.manage`.
+
+Body:
+
+| Field | Type | |
+|---|---|---|
+| `code` | string, min 1 | required |
+| `wabaId` | string, min 1 | optional |
+| `phoneNumberId` | string, min 1 | optional |
+| `displayNumber` | string, min 5 | optional |
+| `businessId` | string, min 1, max 64 | optional |
+| `coexistence` | boolean | optional |
+| `reason` | string, max 500 | optional |
+
+### `POST /api/admin/moranbuy/profile`
+
+- **Access:** Bearer token with `businesses.read` and `businesses.manage`.
+
+Body:
+
+| Field | Type | |
+|---|---|---|
+| `name` | string, min 2, max 60 | required |
+| `reason` | string, max 500 | optional |
+
+### `_ALL /api/admin/moranbuy/api/*`
+
+- **Access:** Bearer token with `businesses.read`.
+
